        "output": "[[2, 3], [1, 3], [1, 2]]",
        "expectedOutput": "[[2, 3], [1, 3], [1, 2]]",
        "explanation": "a triangle among nodes 1, 2, and 3; the input row order within each list doesn't matter, only the resulting sorted adjacency does"
      }
